<title>ROMANIA: ATHLETICS-ROMANIAN BANNED FOR DOPING.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-ROMANIAN BANNED FOR DOPING.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1996-11-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Distance runner Cristina Burca has received a four-year ban from the Romanian Athletics Federation (RAF) after a positive a dope test earlier this year.</p>
<p>Traces of the steroid nandrolone were found in her sample after the half-marathon world championship in Palma de Mallorca in September, RAF general secretary Traian Badea said on Saturday.</p>
<p>Burca said:  &quot;My doctor recommended this spring a medical treatment with nandrolone for me to recover from a muscle rupture.&quot;</p>
